                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="177"/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l3" HPOS="407" VPOS="714" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="409 764 2185 757" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="409 764 409 777 2185 770 2185 757 2181 727 1871 714 1869 714 1702 725 1637 714 1635 714 1633 714 1588 727 1217 716 1215 716 1213 716 1176 727 1146 716 1144 716 1141 716 1139 716 1137 716 1122 729 407 729 409 764"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="because the small, low room is filled with charcoal-fumes, which will not"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l4" HPOS="409" VPOS="779" WIDTH="839" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="412 822 1248 818" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="412 822 412 835 736 846 739 846 830 833 1016 844 1018 844 1245 831 1248 818 1243 790 838 779 836 779 834 779 832 779 832 781 821 790 477 781 474 781 409 792 412 822"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="entirely disappear for a day or two."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l5" HPOS="520" VPOS="846" WIDTH="1663" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="522 883 2183 879" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="522 883 522 896 1001 907 1003 907 1536 894 1618 905 1620 905 1718 894 1837 905 1839 905 1841 905 1871 894 1947 905 1949 905 2012 894 2025 905 2027 905 2029 905 2032 907 2166 907 2166 905 2168 905 2170 905 2183 892 2183 879 2179 848 520 846 522 883"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The winter sleeping-room serves also for only a single small family."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l6" HPOS="409" VPOS="898" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="412 944 2183 937" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="412 944 412 957 2181 950 2183 937 2179 909 1800 898 1798 898 1572 911 409 911 412 944"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Sometimes two inner rooms are joined together at an angle. There is no"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l7" HPOS="409" VPOS="954" WIDTH="1774" HEIGHT="70" BASELINE="412 1006 2183 998" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="412 1006 412 1024 2181 1013 2183 998 2179 967 1869 954 1867 954 1865 954 1828 965 1802 954 1800 954 1798 954 1795 954 1763 965 1741 954 1739 954 1737 954 1735 954 1733 954 1715 967 1412 957 1410 957 1408 957 1406 957 1388 967 1356 957 1354 957 1352 957 1261 970 1245 959 1243 959 1241 959 1239 959 1237 959 1200 972 957 972 921 959 918 959 916 959 849 972 500 961 498 961 409 974 412 1006"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="partition between, and a separate lamp is lighted by each family in its own"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l8" HPOS="412" VPOS="1013" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="71" BASELINE="414 1065 2181 1056" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1065 414 1084 2179 1073 2181 1056 2177 1026 2071 1013 2068 1013 2066 1013 2064 1013 2049 1024 1860 1013 1858 1013 1763 1024 1741 1013 1739 1013 1737 1013 1735 1013 1733 1013 1713 1026 1421 1015 1419 1015 1345 1026 1317 1015 1315 1015 1313 1015 1310 1015 1308 1015 1289 1028 856 1017 853 1017 851 1017 823 1030 576 1019 574 1019 572 1019 570 1019 555 1030 498 1022 496 1022 412 1032 414 1065"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="part. This large double sleeping-room is quite similar to that of the Maritime"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l9" HPOS="412" VPOS="1076" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="414 1121 2179 1117" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1121 414 1136 2174 1141 2179 1117 2174 1086 1295 1076 1293 1076 1291 1076 1265 1086 433 1078 431 1078 429 1078 427 1078 412 1084 414 1121"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Chukchee and Asiatic Eskimo, as will be described later. In my opinion,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l10" HPOS="414" VPOS="1138" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="414 1182 2181 1182" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1182 414 1195 2177 1199 2181 1182 2179 1151 2103 1138 2101 1138 1954 1149 1750 1138 1748 1138 1746 1138 1715 1149 1661 1138 1659 1138 1657 1138 1655 1138 1640 1149 1605 1138 1603 1138 1601 1138 1533 1149 1440 1138 1438 1138 1436 1138 1434 1138 1419 1149 1328 1138 1326 1138 1228 1149 1172 1138 1170 1138 1167 1138 1126 1149 1096 1138 1094 1138 1092 1138 988 1149 940 1138 938 1138 936 1138 934 1138 905 1149 804 1138 801 1138 639 1149 604 1138 602 1138 600 1138 598 1138 596 1138 576 1151 468 1151 442 1138 440 1138 438 1138 435 1138 414 1149 414 1182"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the stationary winter house is the typical form of the Chukchee dwelling,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l11" HPOS="412" VPOS="1199" WIDTH="1769" HEIGHT="59" BASELINE="414 1242 2181 1236" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1242 414 1258 2179 1253 2181 1236 2177 1208 1003 1199 1001 1199 999 1199 996 1199 981 1210 448 1201 446 1201 444 1201 412 1212 414 1242"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="while the movable tent is a variety comparatively new, and not even very"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l12" HPOS="412" VPOS="1260" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="414 1301 2183 1294" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1301 414 1316 637 1327 639 1327 918 1316 1001 1327 1003 1327 1144 1314 1313 1325 1315 1325 1380 1314 2181 1314 2183 1294 2179 1262 474 1260 472 1260 412 1271 414 1301"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="well adapted to the exigencies for which it is used. It is cumbersome, and"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l13" HPOS="409" VPOS="1327" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="52" BASELINE="412 1361 2185 1355" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="412 1361 412 1379 2183 1372 2185 1355 2179 1327 409 1331 412 1361"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="requires many reindeer to carry it, especially when compared to the Lamut"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l14" HPOS="412" VPOS="1381" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="414 1422 2183 1413" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1422 414 1437 832 1446 834 1446 897 1435 988 1446 990 1446 1081 1435 1206 1446 1209 1446 1300 1433 1559 1444 1562 1444 1564 1444 1590 1433 1603 1444 1605 1444 1607 1444 1609 1446 1731 1446 1731 1444 1876 1442 1878 1442 1880 1442 1893 1431 1923 1442 1925 1442 1928 1442 1930 1442 1967 1431 1990 1442 1993 1442 1995 1442 1997 1442 2032 1431 2153 1442 2155 1442 2157 1442 2183 1429 2183 1413 2179 1385 431 1381 429 1381 427 1381 425 1381 412 1387 414 1422"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="tent. When under way, it hampers considerably the progress of a Chuk-"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l15" HPOS="414" VPOS="1439" WIDTH="279" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="414 1483 693 1483" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1483 414 1500 693 1500 693 1483 693 1452 550 1439 548 1439 472 1450 448 1439 446 1439 444 1439 442 1439 414 1450 414 1483"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="chee family."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l16" HPOS="518" VPOS="1496" WIDTH="1667" HEIGHT="71" BASELINE="520 1543 2185 1535" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="520 1543 520 1567 2183 1550 2185 1535 2181 1504 1352 1496 1349 1496 1256 1506 975 1498 973 1498 970 1498 931 1509 535 1500 533 1500 531 1500 529 1500 518 1506 520 1543"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Summer House. — The summer habitation is arranged in about the same"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l17" HPOS="412" VPOS="1561" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="414 1602 2183 1595" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1602 414 1617 2181 1610 2183 1595 2179 1561 633 1561 630 1561 412 1571 414 1602"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="way as the movable winter tent, except that its place cannot be changed"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l18" HPOS="412" VPOS="1613" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="62" BASELINE="414 1662 2183 1654" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1662 414 1675 2181 1671 2183 1654 2179 1621 1802 1613 1800 1613 1798 1613 1795 1613 1780 1623 1622 1615 1620 1615 1520 1626 1505 1615 1503 1615 1501 1615 1352 1615 1349 1615 1347 1615 1345 1615 1330 1626 1269 1617 1267 1617 1098 1628 1042 1617 1040 1617 1038 1617 1035 1617 1020 1630 912 1630 879 1617 877 1617 875 1617 873 1617 871 1617 849 1630 622 1619 620 1619 617 1619 583 1630 526 1619 524 1619 522 1619 500 1630 438 1619 435 1619 433 1619 431 1619 412 1628 414 1662"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="till the first snow is on the ground. Therefore all the sledges are piled"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l19" HPOS="412" VPOS="1678" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="414 1723 2183 1717" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1723 414 1738 2181 1732 2183 1717 2179 1686 1025 1678 1022 1678 1020 1678 999 1688 526 1680 524 1680 412 1691 414 1723"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="together for the summer. The best driving-sledges are untied, and the lashings"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l20" HPOS="412" VPOS="1734" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="414 1784 2185 1775" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1784 414 1799 2183 1790 2185 1775 2181 1745 1782 1734 1780 1734 1778 1734 1737 1745 1347 1736 1345 1736 851 1749 485 1740 483 1740 412 1751 414 1784"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="and wooden parts carefully gathered in bundles and concealed in the middle"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l21" HPOS="416" VPOS="1799" WIDTH="266" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="416 1842 682 1842" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="416 1842 416 1859 682 1859 682 1842 682 1812 613 1799 611 1799 535 1810 509 1799 507 1799 505 1799 503 1799 500 1799 483 1810 459 1799 457 1799 455 1799 453 1799 416 1810 416 1842"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="of the pile."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l22" HPOS="522" VPOS="1853" WIDTH="1663" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="524 1901 2185 1894" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="524 1901 524 1916 2183 1909 2185 1894 2181 1866 2045 1853 2042 1853 2040 1853 2038 1853 2023 1866 1880 1866 1843 1853 1841 1853 1839 1853 1837 1853 1834 1853 1821 1866 1607 1868 1481 1868 1466 1855 1464 1855 1462 1855 1460 1855 1401 1866 1378 1855 1375 1855 1373 1855 1371 1855 1328 1868 1176 1868 1161 1855 1159 1855 1157 1855 1154 1855 1074 1868 1059 1857 1057 1857 1055 1857 1053 1857 968 1870 836 1870 817 1857 814 1857 812 1857 810 1857 808 1857 782 1868 754 1857 752 1857 749 1857 522 1864 524 1901"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The whole is protected with parts of old tent-covers not in use. These"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l23" HPOS="412" VPOS="1918" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="414 1963 2185 1955" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 1963 414 1983 2183 1968 2185 1955 2181 1927 1300 1918 1297 1918 1295 1918 1267 1929 895 1920 892 1920 412 1933 414 1963"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="generally serve as tarpaulins. For the summer tent and for the summer"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l24" HPOS="414" VPOS="1981" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="56" BASELINE="416 2022 2185 2013" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="416 2022 416 2037 2183 2030 2185 2013 2181 1983 440 1981 438 1981 435 1981 414 1989 416 2022"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="sleeping-room, old worn-out covers are used, and the people also wear old"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l25" HPOS="412" VPOS="2035" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="60" BASELINE="414 2080 2183 2074" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 2080 414 2095 2181 2093 2183 2074 2179 2046 1616 2035 1614 2035 1611 2035 1588 2046 442 2039 440 2039 438 2039 412 2048 414 2080"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="clothing which was discarded in winter. The sleeping-room cover is closely"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l26" HPOS="412" VPOS="2095" WIDTH="1767" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="414 2141 2179 2137" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 2141 414 2156 2177 2152 2179 2137 2177 2106 2161 2095 2159 2095 2157 2095 2155 2095 2153 2095 2127 2106 1778 2095 1776 2095 1774 2095 1750 2106 1698 2095 1696 2095 1694 2095 1666 2106 1605 2095 1603 2095 1375 2106 1317 2095 1315 2095 1248 2108 931 2098 929 2098 858 2108 804 2098 801 2098 713 2108 652 2098 650 2098 648 2098 611 2108 581 2098 578 2098 576 2098 412 2111 414 2141"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="cropped with a sharp knife, and is usually put up with the hair side out. A"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l27" HPOS="412" VPOS="2160" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="57" BASELINE="414 2199 2185 2195" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 2199 414 2217 2183 2212 2185 2195 2179 2160 412 2167 414 2199"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="large piece of tent-cover tarpaulin is stretched over it above, resting on several"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l28" HPOS="412" VPOS="2214" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="414 2260 2183 2253" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 2260 414 2275 2181 2271 2183 2253 2179 2225 1629 2214 1627 2214 1624 2214 1579 2225 457 2219 455 2219 453 2219 412 2230 414 2260"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="sticks fastened to the outer frame. This serves to keep off the rain, which"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l29" HPOS="412" VPOS="2277" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="63" BASELINE="414 2323 2183 2314" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 2323 414 2340 2181 2331 2183 2314 2179 2284 856 2277 853 2277 851 2277 814 2288 505 2279 503 2279 412 2290 414 2323"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="would come through the vent-hole and through the small holes of the outer tent."/>
                    </TextLine>
<TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l30" HPOS="522" VPOS="2334" WIDTH="1661" HEIGHT="64" BASELINE="524 2383 2183 2375" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="524 2383 524 2396 2179 2398 2183 2375 2179 2347 1867 2334 1865 2334 1808 2344 1769 2334 1767 2334 1765 2334 1763 2334 1735 2347 1395 2336 1393 2336 1391 2336 1349 2349 1315 2338 1313 2338 1310 2338 1308 2338 1280 2349 522 2349 524 2383"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="The place of the camp cannot be changed during the whole summer;"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l31" HPOS="412" VPOS="2392" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="414 2444 2185 2435" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="414 2444 414 2459 2183 2459 2185 2435 2181 2405 2114 2392 2112 2392 2109 2392 2107 2392 2092 2405 1715 2405 1644 2394 1642 2394 1585 2405 1562 2394 1559 2394 1557 2394 1555 2394 1516 2405 1458 2394 1455 2394 1371 2405 1334 2394 1332 2394 1330 2394 1328 2394 1293 2407 910 2396 908 2396 905 2396 853 2409 830 2398 827 2398 825 2398 412 2407 414 2444"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="but in the middle of June, in connection with the first summer ceremonial,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l32" HPOS="414" VPOS="2450" WIDTH="1771" HEIGHT="65" BASELINE="416 2502 2185 2492" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="416 2502 416 2515 2183 2509 2185 2492 2181 2463 2075 2463 2060 2450 2058 2450 2055 2450 2053 2450 2051 2450 2029 2461 1904 2450 1902 2450 1817 2463 1780 2453 1778 2453 1776 2453 1774 2453 1746 2463 1657 2453 1655 2453 1542 2463 1477 2453 1475 2453 1473 2453 1442 2466 1174 2455 1172 2455 1061 2468 769 2457 767 2457 765 2457 762 2457 745 2470 435 2459 433 2459 431 2459 429 2459 414 2468 416 2502"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the tents are broken up and shifted some fifty or sixty feet. This change"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l33" HPOS="414" VPOS="2511" WIDTH="1773" HEIGHT="67" BASELINE="416 2563 2187 2552" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="416 2563 416 2578 2185 2567 2187 2552 2183 2524 2012 2511 2010 2511 1930 2522 1884 2511 1882 2511 1880 2511 1878 2511 1828 2524 1585 2513 1583 2513 1581 2513 1555 2524 1505 2513 1503 2513 1501 2513 1471 2526 1157 2515 1154 2515 1050 2528 873 2518 871 2518 869 2518 836 2528 793 2518 791 2518 788 2518 414 2526 416 2563"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="is very desirable, because the house is exceedingly unclean. Sometimes at"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l34" HPOS="414" VPOS="2576" WIDTH="1776" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="416 2621 2190 2613" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="416 2621 416 2637 2187 2628 2190 2613 2183 2576 944 2585 914 2576 912 2576 910 2576 810 2587 440 2578 438 2578 435 2578 414 2587 416 2621"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the end of July the family will again change to avoid the offensive smell of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_1-225_l35" HPOS="414" VPOS="2632" WIDTH="1778" HEIGHT="72" BASELINE="416 2682 2192 2673" TAGREFS="TYPE_5">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="416 2682 416 2693 914 2704 916 2704 992 2693 1094 2704 1096 2704 1098 2704 1120 2693 1300 2702 1302 2702 1358 2691 1618 2702 1620 2702 1622 2702 1624 2702 1642 2691 1711 2702 1713 2702 1715 2702 1718 2702 1733 2691 2008 2699 2010 2699 2012 2699 2014 2699 2029 2689 2099 2699 2101 2699 2103 2699 2125 2689 2166 2699 2168 2699 2170 2699 2172 2699 2174 2699 2192 2686 2192 2673 2185 2637 1984 2643 1893 2632 1891 2632 1889 2632 1850 2643 1776 2632 1774 2632 1772 2632 1741 2647 1629 2647 1592 2634 1590 2634 1588 2634 1458 2645 1401 2634 1399 2634 1397 2634 1395 2634 1378 2645 1254 2637 1252 2637 1185 2647 1148 2637 1146 2637 1144 2637 1141 2637 1109 2647 996 2637 994 2637 934 2647 860 2637 858 2637 659 2650 630 2639 628 2639 626 2639 531 2650 440 2639 438 2639 435 2639 433 2639 414 2647 416 2682"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="their old surroundings. Even in winter the people are often driven out of"/>
                    </TextLine>

